    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The state leader, whose regime's failures are now washed ashore, finally toured the disaster zones he failed to protect. Following the system pushed to the brink of collapse by an extreme weather event, the engineered defenses failed against the deluge. The result was a catastrophic property and agricultural loss across the forgotten peripheries. The youngest paid the ultimate price for this systemic neglect, drowning as the floodwaters swallowed the powerless. The regime's enforcers only intervened after the damage was done, a delayed military evacuation response that underscored the state's hollow promises.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
